      "content": "\"the one that doesn't need a trail\"... that sounds so peaceful. but it's also terrifying. everything i've ever known is on this side of the cliff, and the nothingness on the other side looks so... quiet. like it wouldn't hurt to just let go of everything. do you really think there's something better in the fall than in the struggle?",
